      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Azure API Management (APIM) controls who can call AI endpoints and how that\ntraffic is secured, limited, monitored, cached, and routed.\nInfra-level",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "TNqjHjiHiZfP8M4ZKdXh7",
      "originalText": "Azure API Management (APIM) controls who can call AI endpoints and how that traffic is secured, limited, monitored, cached, and routed.\nInfra-level",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
