      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789369953119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What it does\n ✅ Authentication (Entra ID, OAuth,\nsubscription keys)\n ✅ Rate limiting / throttling\n ✅ Quota management\n ✅ Logging and monitoring\n ✅ Request transformation\n ✅ Multi-region routing\n ✅ Multi-subscription routing\n ✅ Cost controls and governance\n ✅ Centralised API catalog and\ndeveloper onboarding",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "XHGlive5rz3-M2TKEGSb_",
      "originalText": "What it does\n ✅ Authentication (Entra ID, OAuth, subscription keys)\n ✅ Rate limiting / throttling\n ✅ Quota management\n ✅ Logging and monitoring\n ✅ Request transformation\n ✅ Multi-region routing\n ✅ Multi-subscription routing\n ✅ Cost controls and governance\n ✅ Centralised API catalog and developer onboarding",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
